# 11g's reply to a pooled session's ping as its first call (#2466): the
# server's piggybacks, the session return among them, then the TTI_STA.
# Captured 2026-11-06 through tools/capture_proxy.py: seerdb's pooled session on
# Oracle 11g XE 11.2.0.2, the DRCP pool started. The TTC payload, without the
# packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column and the |ascii|
# gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  17 02 05 00 05 34 38 35  30 33 17 04 01 00 14 00  |.....48503......|
00000010  00 00 00 02 00 00 00 1c  00 00 00 c3 06 09 01 00  |................|
00000020  00 00 04 00                                       |....|
00000024
